"title":"Allegion (NYSE:ALLE) Releases FY 2026 Earnings Guidance","src":"MarketBeat","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxOZHJVTWlFaFZkY3JYZlF5bzFhSk16Z3ktUmhPemVSS0taZm9oTUVteno1UG5ZN09BMHNwVWF5XzY3STE4el95bzd1b3pPcmtSeW5lNUlhdjdyenR1MlhqWHAyUkpUVE9MVXhPTVZzc3RpOXZ6M3RKZFRDblU5WVVVQUd3VXZ3cHlleFVoXzdQLU9GeThsTGhGNUZJZXhjXzdxcWRWd3oyNDNFaXdSR0VtTzcxbGg2MTQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-23","zh":"Allegion (NYSE:ALLE) 發布 2026 財年獲利指引"},{"title":"Allegion (ALLE) Stock Jumps As Q3 Earnings Stoke Margin Questions","src":"Simply Wall Street","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-23","zh":"第三季獲利引發利潤率問題，Allegion (ALLE) 股價上漲"},{"title":"Allegion plc Raises Earnings Guidance for the Full Year 2026","src":"www.marketscreener.com","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxOQjlGTFZ3cXR1SmwwMTlIMVkwb3hzekJqUmo5N1RIcU4tbG9aYVptOHZuVTc0LXMzOUZzRkUzb3RGckJucVk5by11ZXhwTlJ0cm5hSVByNWp4QWRwQkJvWTdoamFlaGVlYl9ZRDRJQ0htMld0bEdST1B3OXV6R3J4blRXMUF5QjBLbzFUcDEtNEg4Zno5OVg0Vm00dVJyMDU3RnEzSFFIc0wtdXQzX053ZF9DZw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"Allegion plc 上調 2026 年全年獲利指引"},{"title":"Allegion jumps 11% after Q3 beat and raised 2026 outlook (ALLE:NYSE)","src":"Seeking Alpha","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxOTXJNS2U4d2gxdWg3b2JhamgxSlNySjdDTm54S192aEcxTEdWcjZmUGlSZ3VqbWN6NDhmcF8wREl0X3ExdUFHMHVRX0U4bjBMNFk5d2YtQjJpNzF0OXBVYzI5Z3VqV1A3d21XY1hLT0Z4N2VuY1JSc0gzNTBsQ2REMldFVmpWcTR0OUtHdmJNa3ZpMG81eEtPQVVlTFI2bHRrcE00?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"Allegion 在第三季業績好轉並上調 2026 年展望後股價上漲 11% (ALLE:NYSE)"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":7},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-17","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1579241/000157924126000007/alle-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Allegion plc (\"Allegion,\" \"we,\" \"us\" or \"the Company\") is a leading global provider of security products and solutions that keep people and assets safe and secure in the places they live, learn, work and connect. We pioneer safety and security to create a safer and more accessible world. Both developing and partnering are central to our work to create ecosystems that enable seamless access experiences and an uninterrupted and secure flow of people and assets. We offer an extensive and versatile portfolio of security and access control products and solutions across a range of market-leading brands. Our experts around the world deliver high-quality hardware, software, services and systems, and we use our deep expertise to serve as trusted partners to end-users who seek customized solutions to their security needs.","zh":"Allegion plc（「Allegion」、「我們」、「我們」或「本公司」）是全球領先的安全產品和解決方案供應商，致力於保障人員和資產在生活、學習、工作和聯繫場所的安全。我們引領安全與保障，創造一個更安全、更便利的世界。開發和合作對於我們創建生態系統的工作至關重要，這些生態系統可實現無縫存取體驗以及人員和資產不間斷且安全的流動。我們為一系列市場領導品牌提供廣泛且多功能的安全和門禁產品及解決方案組合。我們遍佈世界各地的專家提供高品質的硬體、軟體、服務和系統，我們利用深厚的專業知識，成為尋求滿足其安全需求的客製化解決方案的最終用戶值得信賴的合作夥伴。"},{"en":"We offer the following extensive and versatile portfolio of security and access control products and solutions across a range of market-leading brands:","zh":"我們提供以下廣泛且多功能的安全和門禁產品及解決方案組合，涵蓋一系列市場領導品牌："},{"en":"Door controls, door control systems, and exit devices: An extensive portfolio of life-safety products and solutions generally installed on fire doors and facility entrances and exits. Exit devices, also known as panic hardware, provide rapid egress to allow building occupants to exit safely in an emergency. Door controls and systems include mechanical door closers, automatic door operators, as well as high-performance interior and storefront door systems. In addition, we offer a full range of automatic entrance solutions, including sliding, swing, folding and ICU doors, as well as an array of sensors, controls and security options for commercial and institutional buildings. Sold under leading brands like Briton , CISA , LCN , STANLEY Access Technologies (\"Stanley Access Technologies\" or \"Stanley\"; \"STANLEY\" is the property of Stanley Logistics L.L.C.) and Von Duprin ;","zh":"門控、門控系統和出口裝置：廣泛的生命安全產品和解決方案組合，通常安裝在防火門和設施出入口上。出口裝置，也稱為應急硬件，可提供快速出口，讓建築物居住者在緊急情況下安全退出。門控制和系統包括機械閉門器、自動門操作器以及高性能室內和店面門系統。此外，我們還提供全套自動入口解決方案，包括滑動門、平開門、折疊門和 ICU 門，以及一系列適用於商業和機構建築的感測器、控制裝置和安全選項。以 Briton、CISA、LCN、STANLEY Access Technologies（「Stanley Access Technologies」或「Stanley」；「STANLEY」是 Stanley Logistics L.L.C. 的財產）和 Von Duprin 等領先品牌進行銷售；"}],"markets":[{"en":"CISA Multitop Matic Exit, a secondary lock for single and double leaf aluminum and iron panic doors, brings to market the only \"Made in Italy\" counter-lock featuring a long faceplate.","zh":"CISA Multitop Matic Exit 是一款用於單扇和雙扇鋁製和鐵質緊急門的輔助鎖，為市場帶來了唯一一款具有長面板的「義大利製造」計數器鎖。"},{"en":"LCN Senior Swing 9500IQ/2800, self-adjusted auto operator, is a fully loaded controller with innovative AdaptivIQ technology, minimizing seasonal adjustments and reducing nuisance calls.","zh":"LCN Senior Swing 9500IQ/2800 是一款自調節自動操作器，是一款採用創新 AdaptivIQ 技術的滿載控制器，可最大程度地減少季節性調節並減少騷擾電話。"}],"customers":[{"en":"We sell most of our products and solutions through distribution and retail channels, including specialty distribution, e-commerce and wholesalers. We have built a network of channel partners that help our customers choose the right solution to meet their security needs and help commercial and institutional end-users fulfill and install orders. We also sell through a variety of retail channels, including large do-it-yourself home improvement centers, multiple online and e-commerce platforms, as well as small, specialty showroom outlets. We work with our retail partners on developing marketing and merchandising strategies to maximize their sales per square foot of shelf space. Through a few of our businesses, most notably Stanley Access Technologies, Interflex and our Global Portable Security brands, we also provide products and services directly to end-users.","zh":"我們透過分銷和零售通路銷售大部分產品和解決方案，包括專業分銷、電子商務和批發商。我們建立了一個通路合作夥伴網路，幫助我們的客戶選擇合適的解決方案來滿足他們的安全需求，並幫助商業和機構最終用戶履行和安裝訂單。我們也透過各種零售管道進行銷售，包括大型DIY家居裝修中心、多個線上和電子商務平台以及小型專業陳列室。我們與零售合作夥伴合作制定行銷和銷售策略，以最大限度地提高每平方英尺貨架空間的銷售額。透過我們的一些業務，尤其是 Stanley Access Technologies、Interflex 和我們的全球便攜式安全品牌，我們也直接向最終用戶提供產品和服務。"},{"en":"Our 10 largest customers represented approximately 26% of our total Net revenues in 2025. No single customer represented 10% or more of our total Net revenues in 2025.","zh":"我們的 10 大客戶約占我們 2025 年總淨收入的 26%。沒有任何一個客戶占我們 2025 年總淨收入的 10% 或更多。"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Alle_Allegion Americas","val":3218800000,"zh":"Alle_Allegion 美洲"},{"name":"Allegion International","val":848500000,"zh":"安捷傑國際"}],"total":4067300000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Mechanical Products","val":2713900000,"zh":"機械產品"},{"name":"Electronic Products","val":1075100000,"zh":"電子產品"},{"name":"Service","val":278300000,"zh":"服務"}],"total":4067300000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":3049800000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":1017500000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":4067300000}},"peers":["IEX","FTV","AME","AIZ","VRSK"]}}